# FitForge Project Conventions

## Imports
- Always use `@/` path alias (never relative `../../`)
- Always use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional class merging
- Date operations: always use `date-fns`, never `new Date().toLocaleDateString()`

## State
- All global state lives in `src/store/` — three stores: `userStore`, `trackingStore`, `goalsStore`
- Never mutate store state directly — always use provided actions
- New records always get IDs from `genId()` in `@/lib/utils`
- Dates stored as `yyyy-MM-dd` strings: `format(new Date(), 'yyyy-MM-dd')`

## Components
- No business logic inside UI components — extract to `lib/utils.ts` or a custom hook
- All pages wrap with `<AppLayout>` and start with `<PageHeader title="..." />`
- Page content padding: `<div className="p-6 space-y-6">`

## XP Awards
Always call `addXP()` after user log actions:
- Log workout → `addXP(50)`
- Log meal → `addXP(20)`
- Log weight → `addXP(10)`
- Log steps → `addXP(5)`
- Add water → `addXP(2)`
